WEBVTT

00:56:27.571 --> 00:56:30.118
We'll all communicate
and the world will be peaceful."

00:56:30.142 --> 00:56:32.629
Now we've realized that's
the opposite of the truth,

00:56:32.653 --> 00:56:35.096
because we had an unrealistic
view of human nature.

00:56:35.120 --> 00:56:37.214
We've also learned that these are tools.

00:56:37.238 --> 00:56:40.804
And if you look for a tool like a bus
to get you from one place to another,

00:56:40.828 --> 00:56:41.987
that's fine.

00:56:42.011 --> 00:56:44.645
If you look to give yourself
meaning, that's a mistake.

00:56:44.669 --> 00:56:47.542
We've learned that smartphones
and the rest of the technology

00:56:47.566 --> 00:56:50.304
has to be controlled,
we've got to create rules around it.

00:56:50.328 --> 00:56:53.813
So now what you're watching is,
all across America, parents figuring out,

00:56:53.837 --> 00:56:56.776
"I've got to limit screen time.
I've got to limit screen time.

00:56:56.800 --> 00:56:57.957
What rules do I place?"

00:56:57.981 --> 00:57:00.378
And we're figuring out how
to use that technology.